{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"cuimao-e-o032","title":"大军还邺议并省，毛玠请谒不行，时人惮之共白宜省东曹","accounts":[{"id":"cuimao-a-2ad4702e22a9e1917734","label":"正文","text":"大军还邺议并省，毛玠请谒不行，时人惮之共白宜省东曹","evidence":["cuimao-q-f74d262208dac1493645"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-16a17701b8be345a2fcb","label":"正文","text":"曹操知其情，令存东曹而遂省西曹","evidence":["cuimao-q-7dc6d5cdc1266bb24215"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0301","role":"请谒不行而被时人惮者","evidence":["cuimao-q-f74d262208dac1493645"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"知其情而下令存东曹省西曹者","evidence":["cuimao-q-7dc6d5cdc1266bb24215"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["cuimao-q-f74d262208dac1493645","cuimao-q-7dc6d5cdc1266bb24215"]},"ordering_evidence":"cuimao-q-f74d262208dac1493645","source_order":[12,110,0],"order":2758}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0301","name":"毛玠","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-7dc6d5cdc1266bb24215","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-c9e4420932e761e89bb9","layer":"original","quote":"太祖知其情，令曰：“日出于东，月盛于东；凡人言方〖13〗，亦复先东：何以省东曹？”遂省西曹","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":109,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":55,"end":100,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-f74d262208dac1493645","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-c9e4420932e761e89bb9","layer":"original","quote":"大军还邺，议所并省。玠请谒不行〖12〗；时人惮之，咸欲省东曹。用共白曰：“旧，西曹为上，东曹为次；宜省东曹","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":109,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
